# Installation & Build

This guide will walk you through building the various components of Artemis.

## Prerequisites

- **Go**: 1.26 or higher is recommended.
- **Node.js**: For building the web client.
- **Android SDK & NDK**: For building the Android app (compileSdk 35, NDK r29+).

## Quick Build Guide

- **CLI**: `go build -o pfs ./cmd/pfs`
- **Web Client**: `GOOS=js GOARCH=wasm go build -o web/public/artemis.wasm ./cmd/wasm`
- **Android**: `./build-android.sh`

For detailed instructions, see the specific documentation pages for [CLI](/docs/cli), [Web](/docs/web), and [Android](/docs/android).
